                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">This simple definition creates a box with a parametric width. A glTF 2.0 Display component is used to show the box in the online App.

An Email Export component sends an email containing the image of the "MyScreenshot" Import Bitmap input (exported with the Image Export Options).

The body of the email is built with a Format component from the "MyModelState" Direct Text Input. The placeholder __PARAMS__ adds the parameter names and values used for the export.

In the App, both MyScreenshot and MyModelState are filled automatically using parameter value sources (see below).</item>
                  </items>
