                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The App contains controls for the "BoxWidth" slider and for the "ScreenshotWidth" and "ScreenshotHeight" sliders, which define the resolution of the screenshot.

The "MyScreenshot" and "MyModelState" inputs are not included: their values are set automatically by the export.</item>
